              "id": "17126293"
            },
            {
              "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
              "source": "PubMed",
              "id": "24658384"
            }
          ],
          "value": "RNAi-mediated knockdown in SIFa-expressing neurons causes normal male sexual activity towards virgin females but also vigorous courtship directed at other males and also leads to female hyper-receptivity with a dramatic decrease in copulation time (PubMed:17126293). It also causes reduced sleep and shortened sleep bout length (PubMed:24658384)"
        }
      ],
